On 10 Oct 1994, Dave Hayes wrote:

> "David C. Frier" <duvie@digex.com> writes:
> >Would SOMEONE please explain to me just EXACTLY how this works: if person
> >A posts any kind of shit they want on the Usenet, person B is
> >automatically obligated to devote expensive news server resources to
